<title>USA: Cook Cty, Minn., won by Piper Jaffray.</title>
<headline>Cook Cty, Minn., won by Piper Jaffray.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Piper Jaffray said it won $4.750 million of Cook Cty, Minn., certificates of participation, Series 1996, with a true interest cost of 5.64 percent.</p>
</text>
